      "content": "healing feels like such a joke though. its not even about me, its about them. my parents, my friends... they spend so much time cleaning up my messes and worrying about me. i just feel like i've become this massive weight around their necks. sometimes i think they'd actually be able to breathe better if i just wasn't around.",
